The PHP-7.4 unicode_table_jis.h is retained for comparison: both JIS
decode arrays are identical to the referenced PHP-8.4 arrays.
The old deployed PHP binary/version/configuration was not recovered.

decoder_oracle.c is a test-only harness containing the original PHP C
mb_sjis_to_wchar and mb_eucjp_to_wchar functions and SJIS index tables.
build_php_reference.py extracts these functions and the binary tables.
compat_vectors.bin is generated by compiling and running that C harness.
No PHP web runtime is installed or used by the Rust service.

Rust decoding logic is newly written with checked indexing. Invalid
sequences are rejected deliberately, rather than applying PHP's configurable
mb_substitute_character behavior. UTF-8 is decoded by Rust's strict validator.
There is no normalization or character substitution after decoding.
